# experiments/: track research code, configs, prompts and concise reports only.
# Generated results (tables, per-chunk records, snapshots, galleries, run directories) stay on disk, untracked.
# Full research state lives outside this repository (see docs/research/README.md).
!experiments/**/runs/
experiments/**/runs/**/*.*
!experiments/**/runs/**/*_REPORT.md
!experiments/**/runs/**/SUPERSEDED.md
experiments/**/*.csv
experiments/**/*.jsonl
experiments/**/*.json
!experiments/**/prompts/*.json
